What:		/sys/kernel/mi_rmap_efficiency/enabled
Date:		October 2026
Description:	Boolean runtime switch for CONFIG_MI_RMAP_EFFICIENCY. The
		optional built-in is disabled in the default configuration.
		When built in, policy starts after successful sysfs setup.

What:		/sys/kernel/mi_rmap_efficiency/mapcount_thres
Date:		October 2026
Description:	High-mapcount file-page activation threshold, default 20.
		Valid values are 2 through INT_MAX. Low-memory, allocation
		context and scan-budget limits still apply.
